    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597">

                <pb facs="1001" n="954" xml:id="pg954"/>

                <head>597. Telegram 41 from Geneva to Prague<anchor n="1" xml:id="d597-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-05-08">May 8, 1956, 4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d597-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d597-1"/>
                <p>41. From Osborn.</p>
                <p>Warsaw’s 20 to Geneva repeated information Department 797 notes new Polish
                    Foreign Minister reception May 8. Believe this adequately explains postponement.
                    No record here Wangs having arrived by
                    air past week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d597-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d597-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.93/5–856. Confidential; Limit
                    Distribution. Repeated to the Department of State as telegram 1855 and to Warsaw
                    as telegram 7.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
